WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.059
This query first creates a wide product-level table
with month totals Then

00:00:06.086 --> 00:00:11.627
it unpivots the wide columns into product-month rows
The result is

00:00:11.654 --> 00:00:17.249
long again but it is not the original transaction
table It is one

00:00:17.275 --> 00:00:23.127
row per product-month total That is the key
distinction between reshaping

00:00:23.153 --> 00:00:24.509
and recovering detail
